tack-id":"EX-0001.02","d3f:definition":"Instead of the RF path, the attacker targets internal command/data handling by injecting or retransmitting messages on the spacecraft bus (e.g., 1553, SpaceWire, custom). Because many subsystems act on the latest message or on message rate rather than on uniqueness, a flood of historical yet well-formed frames can consume bandwidth, starve critical publishers, or cause subsystems to perform the same action repeatedly. Secondary effects include stale sensor values being re-consumed, watchdog timers being reset at incorrect intervals, and autonomy rules misclassifying the situation due to out-of-order but valid-looking events. On time-triggered or scheduled buses, replaying at precise offsets can collide with or supersede legitimate messages, steering system state without changing software. The goal is to harness the bus’s determinism, repeating prior internal stimuli to recreate prior effects or to induce resource exhaustion.","d3f:produces":{"@id":"d3f:BusNetworkTraffic"},"rdfs:label":"Bus Traffic Replay - SPARTA","rdfs:seeAlso":{"@id":"https://sparta.aerospace.org/technique/EX-0001/02/"},"rdfs:subClassOf":{"@id":"d3f:EX-0001"},"skos:prefLabel":"Bus Traffic Replay"}]},"subtechniques":{"@context":{"rdfs":"http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#","owl":"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#","d3f":"http://d3fend.mitre.org/ontologies/d3fend.owl#","skos":"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#"},"@graph":[{"@id":"d3f:EX-0001","d3f:attack-id":["EX-0001"],"d3f:top-level":["true"],"rdfs:hasSubClass":[{"@id":"d3f:EX-0001.02"},{"@id":"d3f:EX-0001.01"}],"rdfs:label":["Replay - SPARTA"],"skos:prefLabel":["Replay"]},{"@id":"d3f:EX-0001.01","d3f:attack-id":["EX-0001.01"],"rdfs:label":["Command Packets - SPARTA"],"rdfs:subClassOf":[{"@id":"d3f:EX-0001"}],"skos:prefLabel":["Command Packets"]},{"@id":"d3f:EX-0001.02","d3f:attack-id":["EX-0001.02"],"rdfs:label":["Bus Traffic Replay - SPARTA"],"rdfs:subClassOf":[{"@id":"d3f:EX-0001"}],"skos:prefLabel":["Bus Traffic Replay"]}]},"framework":{"framework_key":"sparta","framework_label":"SPARTA","framework_root":"d3f:SPARTATechnique","label_key":"skos:prefLabel"}}